# Used only by backend/Dockerfile (BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# over the root .dockerignore). The context is the repository root, so every
# rule is `**/` or root-relative; it repeats the essentials of the root list on
# purpose, so this image does not depend on the root list being complete.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
.git
**/.claude
**/.serena
**/.code-review-graph
**/uploads
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Not needed at runtime: tests and their config, docs.
**/tests
**/jest.config.js
**/docs
**/*.md
# Read by the builder itself, never COPY'd into an image.
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
# The other workspace members never belong in the backend image.
frontend
monitoring
plans
